<item>
<title>Sudan's civil war: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/sudan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-sudan-2026-10-23T01:42:28.178Z</guid>
<pubDate>Fri, 23 Oct 2026 01:42:28 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The Sudanese army and the Rapid Support Forces have escalated drone attacks, striking a market in Abyei and killing more than 150 civilians. RSF fighters have deliberately targeted hospitals in El Fasher, worsening medical access. The conflict’s shift to extensive drone warfare is intensifying the humanitarian crisis and prompting renewed UN-mediated peace talks. The UN Security Council is holding a live session on the war’s spread, the impact of drones and hunger. 4,680 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/10/21/world/africa/sudan-drone-strikes.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/10/1168638&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/10/1168612&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c54g1kxw4nvvo&quot;&gt;bbc.co.uk&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE9CMDlmazVBamVpWldmbldRR2tISWEwNGxIQ3dEa0JHUDNtaTlYaGNqYzZWSll3TEFYYi1xRjAzNVlWanJrYzJRbjJJdXJTVnBjdWlsZm1uRGpJdTRHMWc?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/10/22/how-sudans-shift-to-drone-warfare-is-fuelling-a-civilian-crisis&quot;&gt;aljazeera.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMizgFBVV95cUxQM3NDM0JKNUVnM0NkSFpVbEVieUVjdkxGaWkyM0ZJX1lJUDVYT0JEWGJzS1lQU1ExYmRuazBtVzQ5NEJPeHp5bURzbmhiYVpFazBuOVRfN0xrM2t2Um9FNHVEd1p1RHVOVTloWmo3Y09MZHBmcXdVYmQ2a0JfVlNSaXdESzRiTDhOSkJjazBIVEpGaTBFVXpUUTVKbHZLYm40dmRPTDRscUpzWWh4aWppWHF1MXBuN1dveWh6TmdHdGZBWjVYLTcwdUNUYTRuZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Economist&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
</item>
